# DS5006: properties that do not apply to the kind say what the kind accepts.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render piechart with (series = customerId, ymin = 0)
---- expected
error[DS5006]: `series` does not apply to a `piechart`
  --> query:2:25
  |
2 | | render piechart with (series = customerId, ymin = 0)
  |                         ^^^^^^ not a `piechart` property
  |
  = note: a `piechart` accepts `title`, `xcolumn`, `ycolumns`, `xtitle`, `ytitle`, `legend`

error[DS5006]: `ymin` does not apply to a `piechart`
  --> query:2:46
  |
2 | | render piechart with (series = customerId, ymin = 0)
  |                                              ^^^^ not a `piechart` property
  |
  = note: a `piechart` accepts `title`, `xcolumn`, `ycolumns`, `xtitle`, `ytitle`, `legend`
